		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁγ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
